  "solution": {
    "text": "The number of tetrapeptides (sequences) possible involving each of these amino acids (glycine, alanine, valine, leucine) ; It has three (3) peptides linkage the number of permutations in which they can be arranged<br />$\\begin{aligned}<br />& =4 \\times 3 \\times 2 \\times 1 \\\\<br>& =24<br />\\end{aligned}$",
